title ALES43 — Lotus's carried-state filter: a low-pass that spans a re-berthed region without a fresh transient
prompt Continue the ALES recursion loop Lindy-first crux-first; approve my own design rounds and make progress before checking in; send each finished increment to origin and xykj61 as its own signed round; stop at custody gates; baton prin recur
think Every filter rung so far (ALES40 tone, ALES41 shelf, ALES42 stack) runs FROM SILENCE — each call opens the one-pole state at zero, so a filter applied to a region always begins with its roll-on transient. That is right for a whole clip filtered once, yet a keeper filters a region, re-berths, and filters the next; each fresh transient at the boundary is a CLICK. A real filter CARRIES its state across successive spans. Chosen Lindy-first (carried state is what makes a filter a filter rather than a per-call smoother — the foundation every streaming filter, sweep, and real-time base stands on) crux-first (the split-equals-whole property is the decisive move that opens the sweep and the real time base, both of which need a filter that continues).
think Shape: expose the stepping in tone.rye rather than duplicate the crux logic (a drift risk the reds/TAME discipline dislikes). tone.rye grows one public low_pass_carry(clip, start, count, state: *i64, num, den) carrying the caller's state, and low_pass becomes its state = 0 case — ONE implementation, so the carried and from-silence forms cannot drift. New module lotus/tone_carry.rye wraps a Lowpass = struct{ state: i64, num, den } with run (continue from self.state) and reset (return to silence). The struct holds no buffer — a tiny value beside a clip.
think The property is exact by ALES40's stepping law: lp_step is a pure function of (state, x), so splitting a run is exact needing no new arithmetic. Witnessed: a fresh filter (state 0) equals ALES40 low_pass byte-for-byte; a span filtered in two pieces (the second carrying the first's ending state) equals the whole filtered once byte-for-byte (the crux, seam carries no re-transient); a constant filtered in two pieces settles exactly with the second piece continuing (first-of-second >= last-of-first, never a drop toward silence); reset re-opens the from-silence transient; an illegal coefficient refuses BadCoeff leaving the state untouched, an out-of-range span BadRange leaving the clip untouched.
obs GREEN on the first build across five cases (above). The witness also rebuilds and re-runs the ALES40 tone selftest and asserts its GREEN line, proving the low_pass_carry refactor by the shipped witness's green, not by claim. Ran ales_tone, ales_shelf, ales_stack witnesses after the refactor — all three stayed GREEN. tame_style_check GREEN (bans clean, zero-assert ratchet unchanged at 11).
obs Reused whole: tone.lp_step (via the new public low_pass_carry), timeline.Clip/splice. The refactor accretes one public function to a Tier-3 living module (ALES40) — docs-implementation-sync honored by updating the tone.rye README bullet in the same round. Purely local — bounded i16 PCM; no socket, no network, no keys, no funds, no real device, no real sample rate; every custody gate untouched.
loom witness=ales_tone_carry_witness result=green build=first cases=5 property=split-equals-whole state=i64-carried reused=tone.lp_step downstream_green=ales_tone+ales_shelf+ales_stack
file lotus/tone.rye ALES40 accreted — one public low_pass_carry (caller-owned state); low_pass becomes its state = 0 case, one implementation so the forms cannot drift
file lotus/tone_carry.rye ALES43 module — a Lowpass struct carrying its i64 state across spans, run continuing and reset re-opening the transient
file tools/ales_tone_carry_witness.rish the witness that builds and proves it GREEN on metal, and re-proves the ALES40 tone selftest after the refactor
file active-designing/20260814-163000_fill-ales43-lotus-carried-filter.md the self-approved design read for the round
file lotus/README.md front door synced — status list (ALES43 carried filter), the tone_carry.rye rung entry, the tone.rye accretion note, the road-on paragraph, stamp refreshed
recommend keep-going ALES44 can carry the high-pass and the shelf/stack so a whole EQ spans re-berthed regions seamlessly, sweep the coefficient under an envelope (a filter automation), or name a crossover in hertz through a real time base; the signed and wire session carries stay module seams for Keaton's word
